AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment coho:COHO_0000529 "Obsoleted 2026-09-23. KARE, the Korea Association Resource, is another name for the KoGES Ansan and Ansung Study (COHO:0000530), not a separate cohort or a genotyped sub-cohort of it: the KoGES profile calls the study's genome-wide data KARE, the papers tagged KARE describe the KARE cohort as the Ansan and Anseong cohort, and the KARE, Ansan and Ansung tags all denote that one cohort (src/curation/catalog_cohorts_tier_b_check.csv). Replaced by COHO:0000530, which carries the acronym KARE and the KARE names."@en)
